    "body": "Step 1 proven P0: axial DR-0400, part top Z20 under a box stock top Z25, R = Top of Part Z = 20, clearance 35 - generate Ok, warnings [], posted silently through Fanuc (`G00 X0 Y0 Z20` / `G81 X0 Y0 Z12 R20 F80`, Peck `G73 X0 Y0 Z12 R20 Q12 F80`) and Heidenhain's expanded chain (`G00 X+0 Y+0 Z+20`). Fix on branch issue/91-rplane-in-stock (f172a5c, not pushed): drill_reach refuses the R plane below the raw stock top by name at generation; reach/holder read the stock unclipped. Verify-side net held as #96 (it convicts non-drilling fixtures that rapid below their declared stock top). Faced stock still counts raw until #89.",
