    "body": "**Raised to P0** - proved: DR-0400, part top Z20, box stock top Z25, R plane 20: generated with no warnings and posted silently (Fanuc `G81 X0 Y0 Z12 R20` / `G73 ... R20`, Heidenhain `G00 ... Z+20`), the rapid down to R crossing 5 mm of uncut stock. Fix landed locally (f172a5c), gating now: `drill_reach::r_plane_clear` refuses by name, per cycle, any raw stock above the R plane over the tool's body; the depth and holder checks now read the full stock height. Faced-then-drilled stock still counts at raw height until #89. The verify-side check (vertical rapids into stock, which also catches non-drilling ops) is #96. Tests: drill_rplane (3).",
