    "body": "claimed: main session (review fixes for PR #97) · 2026-11-07T16:58Z · branch issue/91-rplane-in-stock · plan: (1) the check is skipped when no stock is declared - an R plane below the part top still rapids into the part and posts silently: check the part (and the stock when present); (2) sloped/drafted stock is read at its highest vertex touching the body disk, not the surface over it - false refusal with a wrong height in the message: clip to the disk; plus seed Drill's Top of Part Z so a default drill on stock with top allowance does not refuse at once (or log it), stronger test asserts, Tap/Bore/Spot/a hole beside the stock covered.",
